        "verdict": "PASS",
        "reasons": "EXECUTABLE is supported. Six WRITTEN_ACCEPTANCE agreements at $450 ($2,700) are recorded for this buyer, so price and conversion are committed and no new sales are needed; five would be $2,250 < $2,500, so all six are required, which the plan states. The recorded fulfiller is the owner personally, which the plan uses; at 1.5 hours a filing, two filings a week is 3.0 hours a week in weeks 1-3 (9 of the 13-hour window), within the 3-hour weekly cap. $0 direct cost and $0 exposure, receipts settle on days 12, 18 and 25 of 30. Recomputed ledger ($2,700, no spend) matches Brain's trace.",
